Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): scope session.list to an audience judged by
 plugins

session.list takes an optional audience; filter_session_list plugin hooks keep the sessions that audience may see, after every other filter and before the limit. A listing no hook judges is refused. Without audience nothing changes.
